COMMENT PRESERVATION AROUND BLOCK SCALARS
---
# header
literal: |- # header comment
  line one
  line two
keep: |+ # keep header
  kept line

# between entries
plain: value # inline plain
next: 1
---
- [update, [literal], replaced]
- [update, [keep], simple]
- [update, [plain], "multiline\nblock"]
- [remove, [keep]]
